      524.1361083984375,
      287.3927917480469
    ]
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "text": "(myo)épithéliales",
    "bbox": [
      72.0999984741211,
      287.9087829589844,
      155.97999572753906,
      301.1927795410156
    ]
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "text": "3) Caractéristiques du TC",
